Project Phoenix Skeleton Code: Unified Data Platform

This structure breaks the project into distinct Python modules (data_ingestion, model_serving, dashboard), which communicate logically via a shared database (simulated by a Pandas DataFrame in this skeleton, but designed for a TSDB like InfluxDB).

